    {
      "source": "The fetching progress is represented as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>paging state</code></a>. Query results are associated with a\n<code>paging state</code> that is used on the next query\nas input parameter to continue page fetching.",
      "translation": "获取进度表示为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>paging state</code></a>。查询结果与一个 <code>paging state</code> 相关联，该状态在下次查询中作为输入参数使用，以继续获取页面数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
