    {
      "source": "Validate the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> whether it can be used for querying. Valid pageables are either:\n<ul>\n<li>Unpaged</li>\n<li>Request the first page</li>\n<li><a href=\"CassandraPageRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CassandraPageRequest</code></a> with a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>paging state</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "验证 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 是否可用于查询。有效的分页请求包括：\n<ul>\n<li>无分页</li>\n<li>请求第一页</li>\n<li><a href=\"CassandraPageRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CassandraPageRequest</code></a> 且带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>paging state</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether there's a next <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> we can access from the current one. Will return false in\ncase the current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> already refers to the next page.",
      "translation": "返回是否可以从当前对象访问下一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>。如果当前的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 已经指向下一页，则返回 false。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether there's a next <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> we can access from the current one.",
      "translation": "返回是否可以从当前对象访问下一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Validate the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> whether it can be used for querying.",
      "translation": "验证 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 是否可用于查询。",
      "count": 1
